        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "What must you sacrifice to escape fate? Find out in this nightmarish dungeon-crawling RPG!\nThe Nightmare continues in Mary Skelter 2! In this first-person dungeon crawler, play as fairy tale-inspired characters called Blood Maidens, each with deeply customizable character-specific classes. Balance between power and madness in turn-based battles with a blood-fueled transformation system, and escape a living prison while indestructible Nightmares give chase in real time.\n\nThis game includes a full remake of the original Mary Skelter: Nightmares with additional story content as a free DLC.\nIt is recommended that players finish Mary Skelter 2 before playing through the remake.\nThe gameplay system revisions made in Mary Skelter 2 are also reflected in the remake of Mary Skelter: Nightmares.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2018",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
